      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COBBLE HILL (3) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by a neck at this track in a handy 34.56 beating Okay Boss. Comes through a solid form race last start. Will go close again if runs up to latest. BOLD ASSAIL (1) was below best last time at this track (34.36) in a Mix 3/4, finishing a 3.5 lengths fourth. Yet to taste defeat in three runs from this draw. Suited here and expected to run well. XARA'S JAI (2) has a strong record this journey with two wins and a minor from five starts. Recorded a 2 length win (34.59) in a R/A FIN last time at The Meadows. Can feature in the finish. XARA NAVY (5) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot most recently.",
